388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 290 0 R
/E (Looking towards the future, SST Makerspace aims to become a launchpad for useful, locally relevant hardware products in Nigeria and beyond, where student-built solutions move beyond prototypes into real-world application. Our competitions are a strategic tool, designed not just to test performance, but to ensure learning remains fun, engaging, and deeply practical, while steadily building the skills required for serious hardware development. By combining structured challenges with the new Product Category, the Makerspace is positioning itself as a space where innovation is nurtured intentionally, talent is refined through experience, and viable hardware products can be developed, validated, and prepared for market impact.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
