<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 294 0 R
/E (The aim of this competition is to design and build an inverted walker robot capable of hanging from a rope and traversing it. The robot must maintain balance, overcome obstacles, and perform specific missions that mimic real-world challenges such as traversal stability and search-and-rescue operations.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
