869 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 314 0 R
/E (We strongly recommend using 3D printing \(Additive Manufacturing\) for those critical, inversely-oriented parts. The materials should be either PLA or ABS plastic.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
870 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2442 0 R
/E (Why PLA/ABS? These plastics are a great choice because they give us the perfect mix of high precision \(accurate prints\), easy manufacturing, and enough strength and structural integrity to handle the operational stress.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
