1019 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 327 0 R
/E (Each team must designate a Team Leader, who will be responsible for registering the team, coordinating submissions, communicating with mentors and organizers, and ensuring deadlines are met. The Team Leader must be the strongest or most reliable member of the team, demonstrated through prior engagement or commitment. This does not require an extensive portfolio; acceptable proof includes participation in previous SST Makerspace events, the recently concluded Design Challenge, relevant coursework projects, or any documented hands-on technical activity. This requirement exists primarily to ensure team stability, accountability, and effective internal management throughout the program.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [2]
>>
